WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.743
"Are you ready, Harry?" Dad asked.

2
00:00:06.744 --> 00:00:10.271
"I guess so," Harry said.

3
00:00:10.272 --> 00:00:14.471
Dad was marching in a parade.

4
00:00:14.472 --> 00:00:17.713
Harry was going with him.

5
00:00:17.714 --> 00:00:20.852
"It will be fun," Dad said.

6
00:00:20.853 --> 00:00:24.271
"We're marching with friends of the zoo."

7
00:00:24.272 --> 00:00:26.758
Harry shrugged.

8
00:00:26.759 --> 00:00:30.039
Watching parades was okay.

9
00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:35.855
But marching in parades seemed boring.

10
00:00:35.856 --> 00:00:41.034
They found Dad's group at town hall.

11
00:00:41.035 --> 00:00:44.792
Harry spotted some of his friends.

12
00:00:44.793 --> 00:00:49.486
They were marching too.

13
00:00:49.487 --> 00:00:52.441
"Look!" Sanjay pointed.

14
00:00:52.442 --> 00:00:55.984
"Fire trucks!"

15
00:00:55.985 --> 00:01:01.265
"I see some cool cars," Jackson said.

16
00:01:01.266 --> 00:01:04.675
"Parades are awesome!"

17
00:01:04.676 --> 00:01:12.152
Harry groaned. "We have to march so far."

18
00:01:12.153 --> 00:01:16.015
"It will be fun," Sanjay said.

19
00:01:16.016 --> 00:01:20.281
Harry shrugged.

20
00:01:20.282 --> 00:01:25.527
More marchers arrived.

21
00:01:25.528 --> 00:01:29.578
A big army truck arrived too.

22
00:01:29.579 --> 00:01:33.601
"Wow," Harry thought.

23
00:01:33.602 --> 00:01:37.665
"The parade is starting!" someone said.

24
00:01:37.666 --> 00:01:41.647
A marching band started down Main Street.

25
00:01:41.648 --> 00:01:44.667
Trumpets blasted.

26
00:01:44.668 --> 00:01:47.865
Drums pounded.

27
00:01:47.866 --> 00:01:52.686
Dad and Harry put on zoo hats and T-shirts.

28
00:01:52.687 --> 00:01:58.888
They began to march.

29
00:01:58.889 --> 00:02:01.824
They handed out animal stickers.

30
00:02:01.825 --> 00:02:06.689
They tossed candy to kids.

31
00:02:06.690 --> 00:02:10.346
"Hi, Harry!" Mom yelled.

32
00:02:10.347 --> 00:02:13.764
Mom was watching with Emmy and Oliver.

33
00:02:13.765 --> 00:02:21.287
"Cool hat!" Emmy cried.

34
00:02:21.288 --> 00:02:24.255
Soon they reached the fire station.

35
00:02:24.256 --> 00:02:27.900
"We're at the end," Dad said.

36
00:02:27.901 --> 00:02:32.317
Harry groaned. "Already?

37
00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:35.783
The parade went so fast!"

38
00:02:35.784 --> 00:02:40.183
Mom found Dad and Harry.

39
00:02:40.184 --> 00:02:43.898
"Did you have fun?" she asked.

40
00:02:43.899 --> 00:02:48.595
Harry nodded. "I like watching parades.

41
00:02:48.596 --> 00:02:55.504
But I like marching even more!"

